			"Message": "docs(Documentation/Rust): Update external links in Rust submodule README\n\nUpdate the Hickory DNS documentation links in the Rust submodule README:\n- Change Hickory DNS homepage link from hickory-dns.rs to hickory-dns.org\n- Replace custom CDN-hosted images with official GitHub avatar\n- Fix license badge link to point to full GitHub URL instead of relative path\n\nThese changes ensure the documentation links remain current and functional.",
