			"Message": "style(Mist): Apply consistent Rust formatting across DNS module\n\nReformat all Mist source files and tests to follow consistent Rust\ncode style conventions:\n- Standardize parameter spacing: `fn Name(Param:Type)` instead of `fn Name(Param: Type)`\n- Consolidate multi-line imports to single lines and reorder alphabetically\n- Simplify function signatures to single lines where appropriate\n- Normalize error message line wrapping\n- Adjust doc comment formatting for consistency\n\nNo functional changes - only whitespace and formatting adjustments\napplied across ForwardSecurity.rs, Resolver.rs, Server.rs, Zone.rs,\nlib.rs, and integration tests to improve code consistency.",
